<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" office:version="1.3" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text">
  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p>Approved Sanctions Clause Template</text:p>
      <text:p>Template ID: SAN-CLAUSE-2026-07</text:p>
      <text:p>Effective date: 2026-08-15</text:p>
      <text:p>Approval ID: LEGAL-2026-811</text:p>
      <text:p>12. Sanctions Compliance</text:p>
      <text:p>Supplier shall not directly or indirectly transact with any person or entity subject to applicable sanctions or expanded sectoral restrictions. Supplier shall screen relevant ownership and control before performance, promptly notify the Company of any potential match, suspend performance where a transaction may be prohibited, and cooperate with lawful compliance reviews. No prior course of dealing constitutes approval to continue a restricted transaction.</text:p>
    </office:text>
  </office:body>
</office:document>
